 "description": "[FREE] One team's profile and its all-time draw statistics.\n\nReturns the team's name, country and type alongside the numbers this database is built\non: matches played, draws, draw percentage, the no-draw streak currently running, the\nlongest one ever, the average of its longest runs, its draw debt and its rank in the\ndraw-likelihood field. Use it to answer \"how often does this team draw?\" or \"how long\nsince they last drew?\".\n\nTakes a numeric id or a slug, whichever you already hold; both come from list_teams.\n\nFree: no key needed, and it costs a key holder nothing either.",
